      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_01_016.wav",
      "subtitle": "今晚也要尽情释放充满爱与和睦的旋律！！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "raika",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "raika",
      "speakerId": "adv_raika",
      "text": "这把吉他，满载着爱呢",
